                                    </title>
                                    <marker start="300232/5s" duration="1/25s" value="stumble"/>
                                    <keyword duration="16500/2500s" start="1500053/25s" value="004 that is it, all over."/>
                                    <keyword duration="277600/2500s" start="1500053/25s" value=" sc2"/>
                                    <keyword duration="9600/2500s" start="1500053/25s" value="003 yashvi emerges"/>
                                    <keyword duration="9600/2500s" start="1500218/25s" value="005 i am finally free."/>
                                    <keyword duration="8800/2500s" start="1500314/25s" value="009 no need to rub it in. some of us still have exams left. or a whole other year of school."/>
                                    <keyword duration="12100/2500s" start="1500402/25s" value="010 yes, boo hoo, this is me, sympathetic, feeling your pain - can i get a high five already?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="5500/2500s" start="1500523/25s" value="011 with a wry smile, mackenzie obliges."/>
                                    <keyword duration="13200/2500s" start="1500578/25s" value="013 working, paying taxes, voting, university..."/>
                                    <keyword duration="6600/2500s" start="300142/5s" value="014 yashvi shifts slightly at the mention of uni. gee mackenzie, way to bring down the vibe. let me enjoy the moment a little."/>
                                    <keyword duration="15200/2500s" start="1500776/25s" value="018 enjoy the summer, you know, leave the adulting for next year."/>
                                    <keyword duration="11600/2500s" start="1500928/25s" value="023 but my plan is basically, get rich on a game show, spend it on a face and neck tattoo."/>
                                    <keyword duration="10600/2500s" start="1501044/25s" value="024 then live out an angry, bitter existence towards all mankind ‘cause i could never get a job."/>
                                    <keyword duration="4100/2500s" start="60046s" value="025 solid life plan, don’t you think?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="8300/2500s" start="1501186/25s" value="028 sounds like you’ve got it all figured out."/>
                                    <keyword duration="6900/2500s" start="1501253/25s" value="029 okay, who are you sexting?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="4200/2500s" start="1501322/25s" value="033 no-one."/>
                                    <keyword duration="9200/2500s" start="1501364/25s" value="034 that’s a seriously juicy emoji cocktail."/>
                                    <keyword duration="4400/2500s" start="1501456/25s" value="035 is that code for something?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="6500/2500s" start="60060s" value="036 mackenzie’s shock sets in as she snatches the phone back, accidentally pressing send at the same time."/>
                                    <keyword duration="3700/2500s" start="300313/5s" value="037 i didn’t mean to send that."/>
                                    <keyword duration="4700/2500s" start="1501602/25s" value="040 it better not be hendrix."/>
                                    <keyword duration="3400/2500s" start="1501649/25s" value="041 i bet it’s ritchie."/>
                                    <keyword duration="3400/2500s" start="1501683/25s" value="042 a mild improvement. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="3700/2500s" start="1501717/25s" value="043 i’m not sexting. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="7800/2500s" start="1501754/25s" value="044 loud enough to be heard by nearby n/s students, further embarrasses her. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="6600/2500s" start="60073s" value="046 you don’t know where olivia went, do you?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="13400/2500s" start="1501891/25s" value="047 in case you can’t tell from - (pointing to her face) - this excitement, i’ve been busy, doing my last exam ever."/>
                                    <keyword duration="9800/2500s" start="60081s" value="048 yes, the business exam that liv was meant to be in too. didn’t you notice she wasn’t there?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="8400/2500s" start="1502123/25s" value="050 all the teachers have been asking if anyone’s heard from her"/>
                                    <keyword duration="3800/2500s" start="1502207/25s" value="049 oh yeah, i didn’t see her. that’s weird."/>
                                    <keyword duration="4900/2500s" start="300449/5s" value="051 apparently she’s missing."/>
                                    <keyword duration="9700/2500s" start="1502284/25s" value="052 like, missing missing?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="10800/2500s" start="1502381/25s" value="055 come on, it’s been what? a couple of hours? "/>
                                    <keyword duration="9500/2500s" start="1502492/25s" value="056 it’s not like her to miss a year twelve exam though."/>
                                    <keyword duration="6800/2500s" start="1502587/25s" value="057 love the girl, but we all know liv is a drama queen."/>
                                    <keyword duration="17400/2500s" start="300531/5s" value="058 she’s probably off living out one of her daydreams somewhere."/>
                                </mc-clip>
