                                    <keyword duration="5200/2500s" start="1246863/25s" value="114 sorry, that was rude."/>
                                    <keyword duration="12700/2500s" start="249383/5s" value="115 we’re all just a little anxious about olivia."/>
                                    <keyword duration="12100/2500s" start="1247036/25s" value="116 i wouldn’t stress, miss. liv’ll turn up once she knows enough people have noticed she’s gone."/>
                                    <keyword duration="16700/2500s" start="1247157/25s" value="117 i probably shouldn’t tell you this, but finn kelly was on school grounds earlier today."/>
                                    <keyword duration="7s" start="249464/5s" value="118 and what... you think he’s got something to do with olivia going missing?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="7600/2500s" start="1247628/25s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
                                    <keyword duration="4800/2500s" start="1247698/25s" value="121 maybe she just got scared then. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="13200/2500s" start="1247742/25s" value="122 she’s missed a year twelve exam and her phone’s off. it’s very unlike her. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="7900/2500s" start="1247866/25s" value="124 you two are friends... has she messaged you by chance?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="7100/2500s" start="249589/5s" value="125 no, i mean i saw her before the exam but -"/>
                                    <keyword duration="10100/2500s" start="1248016/25s" value="126 did she say anything? anything unusual, or strange?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="7800/2500s" start="1248116/25s" value="127 you think this could be serious?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="25600/2500s" start="249639/5s" value="128 we’re worried about her."/>
