                                    <keyword duration="7400/2500s" start="1249336/25s" value="118 and what... you think he’s got something to do with olivia going missing?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="9900/2500s" start="1249407/25s" value="119 no, no-one thinks that-- well, maybe her mother. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="10400/2500s" start="1249506/25s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
