                                    <keyword duration="6800/2500s" start="1229016/25s" value="104 you got your uni preferences in on time?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="17000/2500s" start="245816/5s" value="105 yep - sports science at hawke, nursing at langton. and early childhood at eden hills."/>
                                    <keyword duration="12600/2500s" start="1229248/25s" value="106 you’ve never mentioned early childhood in any of our careers sessions before."/>
                                    <keyword duration="18000/2500s" start="1229361/25s" value="107 well, you know, it comes pretty easy to me. i spend a lot of time with my cousins. (beat) they’re small. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="13000/2500s" start="1229542/25s" value="109 eden hill’s footy team has made the grand final two years running. a heap of aflw players get drafted from there... "/>
                                    <keyword duration="3900/2500s" start="245933/5s" value="110  and hawke. and langton."/>
                                    <keyword duration="12900/2500s" start="1229704/25s" value="111 yashvi, you can’t pick uni courses based on the hope you get drafted from the footy team while you’re there. "/>
