                                    <keyword duration="6500/2500s" start="263327/5s" value="215 duh. because you used to date?"/>
                                    <keyword duration="3200/2500s" start="1316689/25s" value="216 mackenzie’s thrown by the news. an agitated ritchie looks awkwardly to mackenzie"/>
                                    <keyword duration="11400/2500s" start="52668s" value="217 i’m surprised they haven’t hauled you in for questioning. the ex-boyfriend’s always the number one suspect."/>
